@startuml

footbox off

title Sequence Diagram - US008 Register a new city in the System


actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI


participant ":US008 RegisterCityController" as CityController
participant ":CountryRepository" as CountryRepository
participant ":CityRepository" as AddressRepository

Administrator -> UI : **1** I want to register a new city
activate UI
UI --> Administrator : **2** From which country is the city?
deactivate UI
Administrator -> UI : **3** The city is from the country <_countryName>
activate UI


UI -> CityController : **4** getCountryName
activate CityController
CityController -> CountryRepository : **5** getCountryName
activate CountryRepository
CountryRepository -> CountryRepository : **6** validate (_countryName)


CountryRepository --> CityController : **7** <_countryName> exists
deactivate CountryRepository

CityController --> UI : **8** <_countryName> exists
deactivate CityController

UI --> Administrator : **9** What is the name of the city?
deactivate UI

Administrator -> UI : **10** The city's name is <_cityName>
activate UI
UI -> CityController : **11** registerNewCity (_cityName, _countryName)

activate CityController

CityController -> AddressRepository : **12** createAndAddNewCity (_cityName, _countryName)
activate AddressRepository


create "newCity1: City" as City
AddressRepository -> City : **13** createCity(_cityName, _countryName)


AddressRepository -> AddressRepository : **14** validate (newCity1)
AddressRepository -> AddressRepository : **15** Add (newCity1)

AddressRepository --> CityController : **16** true (newCity1)
deactivate AddressRepository

CityController --> UI : **17** success (newCity1)
deactivate CityController

UI --> Administrator : **18** <newCity1> has been registered successfully!
deactivate UI
@enduml